WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:11.700
As we seek the Lord together today, I want to read a prayer

2
00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:15.600
from Reverend Timothy Merritt, who was a pastor in the

3
00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:18.180
Northeast in the 1700s and 1800s.

4
00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:20.460
Let's pray together.

5
00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:24.040
"O Almighty and most merciful God,

6
00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:28.660
permit a penitent sinner to come into Thy presence and make

7
00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:29.860
supplication unto Thee.

8
00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:34.640
Thou, O Lord, art holy and highly exalted, but

9
00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:37.820
I am unworthy and exceedingly vile.

10
00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:41.200
I'm a fallen creature, and my soul is defiled within me.

11
00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:45.920
Thou requirest truth in the inward parts, but I

12
00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:49.660
am filled with iniquity. Behold, I was conceived in

13
00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:53.440
sin, and like the wild donkey's colt, I have been prone to go

14
00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:56.300
astray from the beginning of my days.

15
00:00:56.400 --> 00:01:00.110
My heart departed from Thee, and my desires and

16
00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:02.680
affections became fixed on many objects.

17
00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:06.340
My will grew perverse and stubborn.

18
00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:08.000
My understanding was darkened.

19
00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:12.340
From the head even unto the foot, there is no health in me,

20
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:14.900
but I am full of wounds and bruises.

21
00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:18.200
My whole head is sick, my whole heart is faint,

22
00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:22.780
and I have this further addition to my native

23
00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:23.880
depravity,

24
00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:28.600
that when You put into my hands the means of purifying myself from all

25
00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:29.950
filthiness of flesh and spirit,

26
00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:32.360
I did not use them for this purpose.

27
00:01:33.530 --> 00:01:37.480
Thou hast opened a fountain for my sin and uncleanness, but I have not washed

28
00:01:37.540 --> 00:01:40.140
away my sin. But I have been indifferent.

29
00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:44.680
I have been lukewarm when I ought to be filled with holy resolution

30
00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:45.360
and zeal.

31
00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:50.000
My conduct has been marked with the greatest ingratitude

32
00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:54.030
in delaying my perfect cleansing, and the evil

33
00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:58.010
propensities of my nature have struck deeper root and entrenched themselves in

34
00:01:58.040 --> 00:01:58.500
my heart.

35
00:01:59.450 --> 00:02:02.040
That I have not wholly drifted away from You

36
00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:05.220
is only because of Your tender mercy

37
00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:07.720
and not to any virtue of my own."

38
00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:13.720
Let's continue praying and seeking the Lord and humbling

39
00:02:13.759 --> 00:02:14.900
ourselves before Him,

40
00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:19.700
that He might show us our heart and any areas of impurity there.
